            {
                "entry_id": "e1464aa5-297d-3d25-ac3f-a5ce5c902a06",
                "word": "dreamtime",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "62de7d07-a6fe-388b-9fa7-16f5adc01efd",
                        "entry_id": "e1464aa5-297d-3d25-ac3f-a5ce5c902a06",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of Dreamtime."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of",
                            "alternative",
                            "proscribed"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "675cae18-8f3a-44a2-931d-7ab4f2eb90d6",
                                "sense_id": "62de7d07-a6fe-388b-9fa7-16f5adc01efd",
                                "text": "Initially, having been denied access to men's society and their secret ceremonies, Munn encountered the dreamtime among women, in the occasion of their daily storytelling."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "73472c50-8c5f-4df0-9b94-eff06f66bc44",
                                "sense_id": "62de7d07-a6fe-388b-9fa7-16f5adc01efd",
                                "text": "In becoming the ancestral life-force, the ritual principals are \"taken out of profane 'becoming'\" and are placed within the dreamtime: \"Every ritual, and every meaningful act that man performs repeats a mythical archetype; and ... this repetition involves the abolition of profane time and placing of man in a magico-relitious time which has no connection with succession in the true sense, but forms the 'eternal' now of mythical time.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8bde58f8-7fd8-44a9-bc75-89412a6a17ab",
                                "sense_id": "62de7d07-a6fe-388b-9fa7-16f5adc01efd",
                                "text": "The dreamtime also conveys certain notions of morality."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
